% Cosmic-ray two-moment transport in a static, cold 2D box: total energy (CR + gas) must be conserved
InitCondFile               cr_flux_conservation_ics
OutputDir                  output
TimeMax                    0.01
BoxSize                    1.0
TimeBetSnapshot            0.001
TimeBetStatistics          0.01
MaxSizeTimestep            0.001
DesNumNgb                  20
UnitLength_in_cm           3.085678e21
UnitMass_in_g              1.989e43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s   1.0e5
CosmicRayDiffusionCoeff    1.0
MaxMemSize                 2000
PartAllocFactor            3.0
